<h1>Custom Report Generation</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span class="Path">Reports &gt; Generate Custom Report</span> <span lang="EN-US">in</span> <span class="Mode">Inspection</span> <span lang="EN-US">mode</span><span lang="EN-US">.</span></i></b></p>
<p class="description"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> The data collected during the inspection process can be saved in a custom report file in <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>PDF</b></i></span> format using the Custom Report function. Call <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Custom Report Generation</b></i></span> command and you will see the Custom Report wizard.</i></b></p>
<p class="description">&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Step 1: XML Template and Variables</p>
<p><img src="../INSPECTION_MODE_FILES/custom_report.gif" width="629px" height="547px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head-steptitle">Template Settings section</p>
<p class="whs5"><span lang="EN-US">You can create your own XML templates for reports, that will save you some time, next time you make a report. Press on</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'...'</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">button to load an existing XML template or type-in the path and file name of the template in the field. See <a href="xml_template.htm">XML Template</a> for description of the XML template specification.</span></p>
<p class="whs5"><span lang="EN-GB">Press on</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Preview</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to see the preview of the current page with the loaded template.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="margin-left:36px;"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a6" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></i></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP288536204" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../INSPECTION_MODE_FILES/custom_report_preview.gif" width="838px" height="625px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="sub-head-steptitle">Fields</p>
<p class="whs5"><span lang="EN-US">Contains a table with the variables defined in the XML template.</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:italic;"><i>Name</i></span> <span lang="EN-US">column shows the variable name and</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:italic;"><i>Value</i></span> <span lang="EN-US">column shows the current variable value. Values are editable and if modified the new values are stored in the template. Double-click on the yellow fields to edit their contents.</span></p>
<p class="whs5"><span lang="EN-US">After a template is loaded and the variables values are updated press</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Next &gt;</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">button to continue.</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle"><span lang="EN-US">S</span>tep 2: Report Pages</p>
<p><img src="../INSPECTION_MODE_FILES/custom_report_2.gif" width="629px" height="547px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head-steptitle">Report Pages section</p>
<p class="whs5"><span lang="EN-US">You can define in this section which report pages to include in the report. The XML template is applied to every included page.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use the left/right arrow buttons to add or remove pages to the report.</span></i></b></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use the up/down arrows to rearrange the pages sequence in the report.</span></i></b></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Add All &gt;&gt;</b></span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">button to include all existing pages in the report.</span></i></b></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Clear All &lt;&lt;</b></span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">button to remove all pages from the report.</span></i></b></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="bullet" style="margin-left:36px;"><b><i style="font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">A</span></i></b><span lang="EN-US">fter the necessary pages are included press</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Finish</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">button to generate the report..</span></p>
<p class="Warning" id="P2"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;">In order to have <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>PDF</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">output active, you need to install the pdf995 printer, included in the product package.</span></i></b></p>
<p class="Important" id="P2" style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="var e; if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion)&gt;=4){e=event;} if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) &gt;=2 &amp;&amp; typeof(PopupMenu_Invoke) == 'function') PopupMenu_Invoke(e,'','More Info','More_Info.htm','Plot Window','Plot_Window.htm','Report Generation','Report_Generation.htm','XML Templates for Custom PDF Reports','xml_template.htm');return false;" title=""><img src="../../add_on/ss_btn_see_also.gif" border="0" height="17" width="60" alt=""></a></span></i></b></p>
